Cadence English word pack (words-en-v1)
========================================

Contents: `words-en-v1.tsv` — 25,000 vetted English surface forms with
rank-based frequency bands, extracted on 2026-10-08 with the recipe in
`tools/corpus/dump_words.py` (decision 0002).

